 is a next-gen army warfare game in which you have to survive as a spy commando while coping with the bunch of enemy allied forces. Perform the most intense military commando operations and accomplish multiple thrilling tasks by performing stealth strikes. The use of AI is at its peak in this commando shooting game which has made this sniper game a masterpiece. Gear up with latest weapons as a spy commando. Just crawl in safely to gain access to the main enemy navigation system and disable it on the first priority. Use silent moves only, else you cover will be blown in no time. The enemy elite force commandos are patrolling everywhere, so beware of them", "short_description": "The Last Commando is a next-gen army warfare game in which you have to survive as a spy commando while coping with the bunch of enemy allied forces. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://skippyapps.com/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Skippy Apps PTY LTD.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://skippyapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "858423658773019"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "739954654056711"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "739954654056711"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time